(2480,669,'<div class=\"hint-header\">   Paso 1: Reunir y ordenar los datos </div> <div style=\"font-size:18px; margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">   Se recopilan todos los valores y se ordenan para identificar los que pertenecen al intervalo [73, 82]:   <br><br>   <strong>   3, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 12, 13, 13, 15, 15, 16, 19, 21, 22, 23, 24, 24, 24, 24, 25, 25, 25, 26, 26, 26, 26, 27, 28, 28, 28, 28, 30, 33, 34, 34, 35, 35, 37, 37, 38, 38, 38, 38, 38, 38, 38, 41, 41, 43, 45, 45, 45, 45, 46, 47, 47, 47, 47, 47, 49, 53, 54, 56, 56, 57, 58, 58, 59, 60, 60, 66, 67, 72, 73, 80   </strong> </div>',10,'2025-11-12 00:19:30','2025-11-23 20:26:41'),
(2481,669,'<div class=\"hint-header\">   Paso 2: Resaltar los valores dentro del intervalo [73, 82] </div> <div style=\"font-size:18px; margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">   Los valores que están dentro del intervalo [73, 82] son:   <br><br>   <span style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#800080; background-color:#cce0ff;\">73, 80</span> </div>',20,'2025-11-12 00:19:30','2025-11-23 20:26:41'),
(2482,669,'<div class=\"hint-header\">   Paso 3: Contar los valores </div> <div style=\"font-size:18px; margin-left:20px; line-height:1.8;\">   Se han identificado <b>2 valores</b> dentro del intervalo [73, 82]:   <br><br>   <b>73, 80</b>   <br><br>   Por lo tanto, la frecuencia del intervalo 8 es <strong>2</strong>. </div>',30,'2025-11-12 00:19:30','2025-11-23 20:26:41'),
