(4679,923,'\\[ \\boxed{\\text{PASO 1: SUSTITUCIÓN}} \\] Sustituimos los valores:  \\[ f(1) = 1 + 2 \\]  \\[ f(2) = 2 + 2 \\]  \\[ \\Delta y = f(2) - f(1) \\]',10,'2025-12-10 00:02:34','2025-12-10 00:02:34'),
