(4682,924,'\\[ \\boxed{\\text{PASO 1: SUSTITUCIÓN DIRECTA}} \\]  \\[ f(3) = 2(3) - 1 \\]  \\[ f(4) = 2(4) - 1 \\]  \\[ \\Delta y = f(4) - f(3) \\]',10,'2025-12-10 00:06:18','2025-12-10 00:06:18'),
