(8485,1520,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">   These are the correct answers </span> <br/> <br/>  1. Is your new laptop  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">lighter than</span> (light) your old one? <br/> 2. Are electric cars usually  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">quieter than</span> (quiet) gasoline cars? <br/> 3. This new app is very simple. It’s  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">easier than</span> (easy) the previous version. <br/>',10,'2026-02-04 21:36:55','2026-02-04 21:36:55'),
(8486,1520,'4. I like this chair, but I need a  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">more comfortable</span> (comfortable) one. <br/> 5. This smartphone is  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">more powerful</span> (powerful) than my last phone. <br/> 6. My new headphones aren’t  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">better than</span> (good) the old ones. They’re actually  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">worse</span> (bad).<br/>',20,'2026-02-04 21:36:55','2026-02-04 21:36:55'),
(8487,1522,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">   Las siguientes son las respuestas correctas </span> <br/> <br/>  1. Is TikTok  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">more popular than</span> (popular) Facebook among teenagers? <br/> 2. Online games are usually  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">more exciting than</span> (exciting) board games. <br/>',10,'2026-02-04 21:38:27','2026-02-04 21:38:27'),
(8488,1522,'3. This video game is  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">harder than</span> (hard) the last one I played. <br/> 4. My new backpack is  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">lighter than</span> (light) my old one. <br/> 5. Watching series at home is  <span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">cheaper than</span> (cheap) going to the cinema.',20,'2026-02-04 21:38:27','2026-02-04 21:38:27');
