(530,'Problema # 530','135',3,'latex','1',10,0,'<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head>   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">   <title>Verb Practice</title>   <style>     body {       font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;       background-color: #ffffff;       color: #333;       padding: 40px;       line-height: 1.6;     }      h1 {       font-size: 22px;       color: #333;       margin-bottom: 20px;     }      .instruction {       font-size: 18px;       margin-bottom: 20px;     }      .verb-box {       background-color: #e6d6f2;       border: 1px solid #d3c1e0;       padding: 12px;       margin-bottom: 30px;       text-align: center;       font-size: 18px;       font-weight: 500;       letter-spacing: 1px;     }      .sentence {       margin-bottom: 25px;     }      .sentence p {       margin: 4px 0;       font-size: 17px;     }      .highlight {       color: #0077cc;       font-weight: bold;     }   </style> </head> <body>    <h1>Verb Practice</h1>    <div class=\"instruction\">    Complete the conversations with the gerund forms of the verbs. In the answer box, write each verb in the order that corresponds to each sentence, leaving only one space between each word.   </div>    <div class=\"verb-box\">     be &nbsp;&nbsp; buy &nbsp;&nbsp; get &nbsp;&nbsp; go &nbsp;&nbsp; help &nbsp;&nbsp; lose &nbsp;&nbsp; meet &nbsp;&nbsp; travel &nbsp;&nbsp; try &nbsp;&nbsp; volunteer   </div>    <div class=\"sentence\">     <p><strong>1</strong> A <span class=\"highlight\">Do you enjoy ___ alone or in a group?</span></p>     <p>  B I prefer ___ in a large group. It’s more fun.</p>   </div>    <div class=\"sentence\">     <p><strong>2</strong> A <span class=\"highlight\">Are you interested in ___ handicrafts when you travel?</span></p>     <p>  B Not really. I like ___ to markets, but just to look.</p>   </div>    <div class=\"sentence\">     <p><strong>3</strong> A <span class=\"highlight\">Local food is the best way to learn about a culture. Don’t you agree?</span></p>     <p>  B I’m not really sure. ___ local people is also good.</p>   </div>    <div class=\"sentence\">     <p><strong>4</strong> A <span class=\"highlight\">Are you worried about ___ sick when you travel abroad?</span></p>     <p>  B Not really. I’m more concerned about ___ my passport!</p>   </div>    <div class=\"sentence\">     <p><strong>5</strong> A <span class=\"highlight\">Do you think ___ on vacation would be fun?</span></p>     <p>  B I do. ___ other people is a great thing to do.</p>   </div>  </body> </html>',0,1,'2025-10-24 05:35:31','2025-12-31 01:21:39'),
