(1514,'Eng31.1.1.-1','271',5,'ranuras','1',10,0,'1 Is your new printer _faster-than_ (fast) your old one? <br/>\n2 Are desktop computers always _heavier-than_ (heavy) laptops? <br/>\n3 This new camera is really cheap! It’s _less-expensive_ (expensive) than my old one. <br/>\n4 I like this TV, but I think I want a _bigger_ (big) one.<br/>\n5 This phone has a big screen, so it’s _more-expensive_ (expensive) than other phones.<br/>\n6 My new camera isn’t _better-than_ (good) my old one. In fact, it’s _worse_ (bad)!',0,0,'2026-02-01 21:05:52','2026-02-01 21:05:52'),
