(1520,'Eng3.1.1.1-1','271',5,'ranuras','1',10,0,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">\n  Complete the sentences with the correct comparative form.\n</span>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n1. Is your new laptop _lighter-than_ (light) your old one? <br/>\n2. Are electric cars usually _quieter-than_ (quiet) gasoline cars? <br/>\n3. This new app is very simple. It’s _easier-than_ (easy) the previous version. <br/>\n4. I like this chair, but I need a _more-comfortable_ (comfortable) one. <br/>\n5. This smartphone is _more-powerful_ (powerful) than my last phone. <br/>\n6. My new headphones aren’t _better-than_ (good) the old ones. They’re actually _worse_ (bad).<br/>',0,1,'2026-02-01 21:08:41','2026-02-02 12:13:12'),
(1521,'Eng3.1.1.1-2','271',5,'ranuras','1',10,0,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">\n  Complete the sentences with the correct comparative form.\n</span>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n1. Is TikTok _more-popular-than_ (popular) Facebook among teenagers? <br/>\n2. Online games are usually _more-exciting-than_ (exciting) board games. <br/>\n3. This video game is _harder-than_ (hard) the last one I played. <br/>\n4. My new backpack is _lighter-than_ (light) my old one. <br/>\n5. Watching series at home is _cheaper-than_ (cheap) going to the cinema. <br/>\n6. This math test was _easier-than_ (easy) the previous one. <br/>\n7. My new phone isn’t _better-than_ (good) my friend’s phone. It’s actually _worse_ (bad). <br/>\n8. Studying with music is _more-relaxing-than_ (relaxing) studying in silence for me. <br/>\n9. Electric scooters are _faster-than_ (fast) bicycles in the city. <br/>\n10. Learning English online is _more-convenient-than_ (convenient) attending extra classes.',0,0,'2026-02-04 21:16:14','2026-02-04 21:16:14'),
(1522,'Eng3.1.1.1-2','271',5,'ranuras','1',10,0,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">\n  Complete the sentences with the correct comparative form.\n</span>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n1. Is TikTok _more-popular-than_ (popular) Facebook among teenagers? <br/>\n2. Online games are usually _more-exciting-than_ (exciting) board games. <br/>\n3. This video game is _harder-than_ (hard) the last one I played. <br/>\n4. My new backpack is _lighter-than_ (light) my old one. <br/>\n5. Watching series at home is _cheaper-than_ (cheap) going to the cinema.',0,1,'2026-02-04 21:19:22','2026-02-04 21:22:58'),
(1523,'Eng3.1.1.1-3','271',5,'ranuras','1',10,0,'<span style=\"color: royalblue; font-weight: bold;\">\n  Complete the sentences with the correct comparative form.\n</span>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n\n1. This math test was _easier-than_ (easy) the previous one. <br/>\n2. My new phone isn’t _better-than_ (good) my friend’s phone. It’s actually _worse_ (bad). <br/>\n3. Studying with music is _more-relaxing-than_ (relaxing) studying in silence for me. <br/>\n4. Electric scooters are _faster-than_ (fast) bicycles in the city. <br/>\n5. Learning English online is _more-convenient-than_ (convenient) attending extra classes.',0,1,'2026-02-04 21:23:21','2026-02-04 21:26:17');
